ify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">最近，具身行业讨论“无本体进行后训练的可能性”的热度很高。国内外目前还没有团队做出可行方案。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">说白了，无论是大模型还是具身机器人，想真正好用，光靠预训练打基础可不行，最终落地全靠“后训练”来调教。启元机器人首席科学家董豪告诉AI科技评论：“预训练提升的是下限，上限还得看后训练。”</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">当前具身公司追求进厂打工、家庭保洁等真实落地，比的就是成功率，也就是在比拼后训练的实力。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">可后训练，难就难在它得跟真实物理世界打交道，过去都得用纯真机数据。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">但真机训练成本太高，要大规模铺开，那么多的机器人本体，硬件磨损、场地、人工都是天价。所以，行业内预训练已经开始转向用“无本体”设备采集数据，虽然量上去了，但传统后训练最关键的“纠错”环节却没法搞定。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">为了解决这个行业难题，北大和启元机器人董豪团队推出了HIL-UMI。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这个工作，围绕着具身后训练阶段无本体的前提下，围绕着最关键的“纠错”环节展开。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;5cb43f88-3839-4c6c-8e49-a697bfa75a55&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:132,&quot;width&quot;:691,&quot;currHeight&quot;:132,&quot;currWidth&quot;:691,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:132,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:691,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FGlhLbsjuXoRtQkxdSf0c7HBCn4g%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;GlhLbsjuXoRtQkxdSf0c7HBCn4g&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:38407,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e86dd8311.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.191027496382055" data-type="png" data-w="691" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="691" data-height="132" data-backw="546" data-backh="104" data-imgfileid="100263514" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e86dd8311.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 0px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 14px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;" mpa-font-style="mvamdqej1ya3"><span textstyle="" style="color: #888888; font-style: italic">论文地址：https://arxiv.org/pdf/2609.20659</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 14px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;" mpa-font-style="mvamdqejz61"><span textstyle="" style="color: #888888; font-style: italic">项目主页：https://hil-umi.github.io</span></span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvame1whtqo"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e86e1d3ca.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e86e1d3ca.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">01</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">具身后训练的成本，</span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">为何远超大模型RLHF？</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">跟大模型比起来，具身行业的后训练太贵，是很多具身模型无法尝试Scaling的重要原因。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">大语言模型能变得这么好用，大家心里都清楚：不光是预训练数据量大，更关键的是后面有RLHF（人类反馈强化学习，可以简单理解为数据标注）和DPO这些“后训练”的功劳。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">但具身机器人的后训练，成本可比大模型的RLHF高出不止百倍。大模型做RLHF，无非是请更多人坐在电脑前点点选选；可具身机器人，那就得真刀真枪地跟物理世界打交道。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">拿传统上最常用的DAgger，也就是用人类或者算法作为专家评价后训练的模式，这套流程虽然有效，但又贵又慢。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">比较常见的，是以传统的真机人在回路（也就是 HG-DAgger：Human-Gated DAgger），机械臂在运作，人类操作员坐在旁边高度紧张地盯着，等它快抓空、快撞车的时候紧急接管，把正确的轨迹录下来，这就是人类来把关整个训练回路。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">最麻烦的是，每次校正完，还得人工把被碰乱的现场恢复原样。等机器人执行，人工干预，环境复位，一坐一下午，能用的数据不多。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这其中绝大部分时间，都耗在机器人的笨拙动作和人工环境复位上。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这种又慢又烧钱的模式，让后训练数据规模采集成了个老大难，严重限制了规模化。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这就引出了一个核心问题：我们能不能摆脱真机，就像平时做家务一样，顺手就把模型最需要的“纠错”数据给采集了？</span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvamei2pdxi"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e86e54193.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e86e54193.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">02</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">HIL-UMI 的底层逻辑：</span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">给UMI 采集加了一个“模型大脑”</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">HIL-UMI 的做法非常聪明，概括起来就是一句话：“不用机器人，也能给机器人补课。”</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">HIL-UMI ，指的是Human-In-the-Loop（人在环路）UMI，和过去大家常用 UMI（手持夹爪）采集数据不同，HIL-UMI 的采集，不是“盲目”的，而是加入了一个模型。</span></section><section class="custom_select_card_wrp channels_iframe_wrp" nodeleaf=""><mp-common-videosnap class="js_uneditable custom_select_card channels_iframe videosnap_video_iframe videosnap_video_iframe" data-pluginname="mpvideosnap" data-url="https://findermp.video.qq.com/251/20304/stodownload?encfilekey=KGDRibp2wkicJP33Y7a9RVIBcLCHawYKS9iaN4Fly9XVeF1083wk3vbZFFdxmpiafX32KjfkPyGfvLEFLnuMuCZrAw&amp;token=cztXnd9GyrEKhicwwetXseyjtQs40CTvqUpnjLibmiccj4UcSvibomTia7jEibxbc1f23QaIjDMQXgP8SeuTVGBqicbJo6K9c2bibZ6tiaicia1MXbgOVpTEWDpYaOkgl2bgvIL8rhmkFYOke2Piaic0EOuNcBia0NgG9JvPsN4Ktvp7iaq4HMgPpImsxClgiaqYE5BzGRlHIiblI2UKZ5xnt23zlcpeLh4xho6J36LsstuEbW7gCKLyy7b0&amp;hy=SH&amp;idx=1&amp;m=&amp;scene=2&amp;uzid=1&amp;wxampicformat=503&amp;picformat=200" data-headimgurl="https://wx.qlogo.cn/finderhead/ibKHP1TZZeXLIlsBxiajd7MN7AjrMxBndYzBxsBiaz6ydKXaNMHu4iaJbXYHV4bJibTCiavD2xC9cy2AA/0" data-username="v2_060000231003b20faec8c4e68c1ec2d5ca05eb36b0770eb2c5b20a7862cab9873497599c583f@finder" data-nickname="互联网热榜说" data-desc="近100%完成度！不用真机，机器人训练迎来“开挂”新模式。#北京大学 #董豪 #上纬新材 #启元机器人#启元具身智能研究院" data-nonceid="10955497417116451951" data-width="904" data-height="1616" data-type="video" data-parentwidth="362" data-id="export/UzFfBgAAxN6qPFoddUqpk8zT4DCLxS1mUecBcPTroA7mJuwt_g" data-isdisabled="0"></mp-common-videosnap></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">HIL-UMI 把模型直接接进了这个手持采集过程：</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">真实世界里只有人在动： 操作员手里拿着 UMI 夹爪正常干活（比如抓玩具、叠毛巾），摄像头同步拍摄画面。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">模型在后台“脑补”： 模型接收着相同的画面和任务指令，在后台快速预测“如果换我来，接下来的 20 步动作该怎么做”，但它并不真正控制任何机械臂。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">发现分歧立刻触发提示： 系统在后台实时比对人类实际动作与模型预测动作。如果两者差不多，说明模型已经掌握，不需要重复录；一旦发现模型“脑补”的轨迹跟人类的真实操作严重跑偏（说明模型在这个场景下是个“生手”），系统就会立刻提示操作者：“这一段模型不会，从这里开始多教一段！”</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 0px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;7dc30661-d55a-4d15-8915-6c267ee61b53&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:266,&quot;width&quot;:967,&quot;currHeight&quot;:266,&quot;currWidth&quot;:967,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:266,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:967,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FZLoGb2cgKod7qXx7KIycKwiBn9J%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;ZLoGb2cgKod7qXx7KIycKwiBn9J&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:196562,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e86e89c69.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.2750775594622544" data-type="png" data-w="967" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="967" data-height="266" data-backw="546" data-backh="150" data-imgfileid="100263513" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e86e89c69.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 14px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;" mpa-font-style="mvan1kvdtpt" data-mpa-action-id="mvan1kvqpf4" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span textstyle="" style="color: #888888">手持夹爪与采集设备</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">整个过程，不需要机械臂在场，更不需要机器人真去犯一次错。人类在示范的同时，就把模型在真实部署中极可能翻车的场景给定点捕获了。</span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvamfadv1ngf"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e86ec3dc3.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e86ec3dc3.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">03</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">不是数采集工具，</span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">是后训练里的数据飞轮</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">如果只把 HIL-UMI 理解为一个手持记录仪，那就低估它了。它真正厉害的地方，是建立了一套让模型自己吐出“错题本”的自闭环系统。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这个闭环有两大技术支柱：</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">第一步：动作分歧检测（抓出盲区）。</span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;机器人操作面对同一种情况，往往有多种合理姿态。HIL-UMI 不看单次预测，而是并行采样多组动作块去算“能量分布”（Energy Score）。模型如果胸有成竹，动作分布会很收敛；一旦模型给出的动作又分散又和人类偏离很大，系统就判定模型进入了“分布外状态（OOD）”，果断启动补录。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">第二步：优势估计器（区分有效动作与无意义晃动）。</span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;光学会动还不够，还得知道动作对任务推进有没有用。在叠方块任务里，夹着方块在空中犹豫晃动，和精准对准底座放下去，完全是两码事。HIL-UMI 引入了一个根据前后画面评估“任务推进程度”的估计器，并采用“优势条件”训练——告诉模型不仅要学这段纠正，还要专挑那些能够实质性推进任务进度的动作来学。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">真正的闭环在于“动态更新”： 每一轮定向补充完数据后，模型完成迭代。到了下一轮采集，模型变聪明了，曾经卡住它的地方不再触发警报；相反，它与人类的分歧点会推移到更深、更难的边缘场景上。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">模型不断暴露新盲区，人针对性示范，模型再进化，整套流水线像滚雪球一样自我迭代，彻底告别了“盲目海量刷正向数据”的低效。</span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvamfsrz1kne"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e86f3c88b.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e86f3c88b.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">04</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">无本体后训练的路线对比</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">为了更客观地理解 HIL-UMI，我们需要把它放在当前行业的几条主要路线上对比：</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">真机遥操作与真机 DAgger： 数据最保真，但单机成本高、折旧大、操作门槛高，想铺到上万台规模几乎不可能。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">仿真（Sim2Real）与强化学习： 算力便宜、能大量生成数据，但在柔性物体（如衣物）、摩擦力和复杂光照下，仿真差距（Sim-to-Real Gap）至今仍是巨大鸿沟，而且不能当作真机后训练。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">海量视频预训练： 规模无限大，但缺少物理力学信息与精准动作维度，多用于给模型建立“常识感知”，无法直接转化为毫米级的精准控制，常用于预训练。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">传统 UMI（无本体正向采集）： 便宜、人人能采，但只能采正例，无法解决模型在长尾错误中的恢复问题，也只能当做预训练。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">HIL-UMI 正好卡在一个极佳的甜蜜点上：它借用了 UMI 的低成本与易规模化，又借用了 DAgger 的针对性纠错能力，同时把两者的缺点全都甩掉了。</span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvami9z4ij3"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e86f6ee69.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e86f6ee69.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">05</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">效率提升 5.63 倍，</span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">后训练终于不必围着机械臂转</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">工程上的账算不算得过来，看两组对比就明白了：</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">定向补课 vs 盲目多学： 在真实机械臂上的四项任务（折毛巾、整理桌面、叠方块、盖章）测试中，给相同的数据帧数预算，持续增加普通示范的常规 SFT 微调，最终任务平均进度分（TPS）只从 44.3 龟速爬到 58.0；而用了 HIL-UMI 定向纠错机制后，平均分直接冲到了 94.8。在最考验精度的叠方块和盖章任务上，成功率达到了100分。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">采集效率直接翻了 5.63 倍：</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" nodeleaf=""><iframe class="video_iframe rich_pages" data-src="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4740293683466420225" data-mpvid="wxv_4740293683466420225" data-vidtype="2" data-cover="http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FXqAicMdcoiafOl2r3qAqfsic7iaULvsWmkNZPF0wyBWTywFQPCQYpf4FJjicgUVOkKaRFdicoaMcqSCScdbA36N7gwHqgbQYYCKd3qMROcAKyZ94k%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg" data-ratio="1.7777777777777777" data-w="1280"></iframe></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;9514a6bd-7940-4f5b-ad49-6b2bf61fa16d&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:225,&quot;width&quot;:993,&quot;currHeight&quot;:225,&quot;currWidth&quot;:993,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:225,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:993,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FYBEcbArw1onXZexpGYJcaXxrnud%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;YBEcbArw1onXZexpGYJcaXxrnud&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:105076,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e86f99d8a.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.22658610271903323" data-type="png" data-w="993" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="993" data-height="225" data-backw="546" data-backh="124" data-imgfileid="100263516" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e86f99d8a.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">能看出来，横轴从初始模型 Base 到三轮更新 Iter1—Iter3，纵轴为任务进度分数。紫色为 SFT，橙色为去掉优势机制的 HIL-UMI，绿色为完整 HIL-UMI；最右侧为四项任务的平均分。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;在极其复杂的“整理桌面”长程任务中，真机 HG-DAgger 采集一帧有效数据要耗时 412.99 毫秒，而 HIL-UMI 只要 73.40 毫秒，单位时间采集效率提升了整整 5.63 倍，毕竟人手直接采集比遥控机器人来采集方便多了。（雷峰网）</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;74522235-90e5-4272-b553-43f953e52226&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:363,&quot;width&quot;:861,&quot;currHeight&quot;:363,&quot;currWidth&quot;:861,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:363,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:861,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FSGLUbX9QOom81Axg6j9cfiNInWg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;SGLUbX9QOom81Axg6j9cfiNInWg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:79695,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e86fc19bf.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.42160278745644597" data-type="png" data-w="861" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="861" data-height="363" data-backw="546" data-backh="230" data-imgfileid="100263515" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e86fc19bf.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">左图为四项任务平均分随累计采集时间的变化；右图为整理桌面任务中各方法随训练阶段的表现。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">省下的这 5 倍多时间，全都是以前机械臂慢吞吞移动、操作员等待、以及人肉复原现场的“无效损耗”。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">在我们看来，更重要的商业想象力在于：真机遥操作对工人手法要求极高，稍微抖动就成了劣质数据；而手持夹爪“人天生就会，轨迹质量极高”。这意味着后训练第一次具备了“分布式”的可能。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">未来，可能是在全国各地的普通民居里，由兼职人员拿着几百块钱的简易设备做日常动作，后台连着同一个云端大模型，模型在谁那里察觉到了动作分歧，就静默抓取那一小段高质量差分数据回传。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">具身后训练，终于不需要把所有人都在实验室里，用机械臂完成了。</span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvamisi7kmm"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e86ff0283.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e86ff0283.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">06</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">“未来的后训练发展，</span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">比的是速度和效率”</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">在采访中，启元机器人首席科学家董豪给出了一个非常反共识的判断：</span></section><blockquote style=""><p><span leaf="">“预训练和后训练不是简单的比例关系，它们是一个阶段性更替。”</span></p></blockquote><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">在他看来，就像当年 DeepMind 做 AlphaGo，一开始用棋谱做模仿学习（预训练），但真正让它封神的，是后面自己跟自己博弈、大规模强化学习的后训练阶段。现在的机器人大模型同样如此：预训练解决起步的世界观构建，路线相对清晰；但未来谁能真正走向泛化与极致成功率，胜负手全在“可规模化的后训练”。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">如果说过去两年具身智能拼的是谁先拿大模型把机器人“点亮”，那么下半场的竞争，拼的就是谁能用最低的边际成本、最快地构建起机器人的纠错网络。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">在具身模型从“能跑通 Demo”跨向“进驻千万家”的关键转折点上，产业到底在打什么算盘？下一代基模与后训练体系又将如何演进？</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">近期，我们也将带来对北大副教授、启元机器人首席科学家董豪的独家专访，聊聊具身学术和产业的融合和互补，敬请期待。（雷峰网）</span></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e8701fdf8.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.40816326530612246" data-s="300,640" data-type="jpeg" data-w="735" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/cNFA8C0uVPtpVCDiaS2EaHCACUnIg1GpV6VicRibhE6bzGDzQOWbLmsyibOW0t5FaPLcotsJBp1SMa8sc1ACXBwSkA/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx1="0" data-cropselx2="546" data-cropsely1="0" data-cropsely2="223" data-imgfileid="100243569" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e8701fdf8.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mpzpilb31bbr"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);letter-spacing: 0.578px;" data-mpa-action-id="mp0lz1ofco1" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section hm_fix="374:463" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;width: 677px;transform: rotate(0deg);" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;width: 50px;height: 4px;background-color: rgb(68, 153, 231);" mpa-from-tpl="t"><svg viewbox="0 0 1 1" style="float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;" mpa-from-tpl="t"></svg></section></section><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: -4px;padding: 10px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239);" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;text-align: center;"><strong style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="" mpa-is-content="t"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7">上车，带你看遍全球 AI 顶会精华</span></span></strong></p><span data-mpa-action-id="mqgg2nab13jb"></span></section></section></section></section></section><section data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p data-pm-slice="0 0 []" style="text-align: center;margin: 0px 16px 8px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold">可独家畅览：</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold">专家演讲PPT</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold">大会报告全文</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold">热门论文解读</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold">学术新星访谈</span></span></p><span data-mpa-action-id="mqgg35eosx9"></span><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e8705a735.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1" data-s="300,640" data-type="png" data-w="1000" style="width:100%;" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/XqAicMdcoiafMqpEPibJ4AOibc6RBL778iaiciaVgquCMrS14ia0XmXfw3YAU5iaSJzBYQOBMNGlM0ic387w7rB6QnU0PO9KPyGqXc8vu6ib2OlB3QIIIQ/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx1="0" data-cropselx2="546" data-cropsely1="0" data-cropsely2="546" data-imgfileid="100262550" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad6e8705a735.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span data-eleid="11"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold">扫描上方二维码</span></span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span data-eleid="11"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold">或点击</span></span><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold">「</span></span><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold">阅读原文</span></span><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold">」</span></span><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold">关注专区。</span></span></span></p></section></section><section><span data-lark-record-format="docx/record"></span></section><section><span data-mpa-action-id="mipr37w01zjd"></span></section>]]></description>
