<item>
<title>华中师大 CoReFuse-Med：先净化再融合，让低质模态不再拖后腿｜ACM MM 2026</title>
<link>https://www.leiphone.com/category/private/QgMWStz8hCPsFf68.html</link>
<description><![CDATA[<section data-mid="" data-mpa-action-id="mvencclp1qtl" data-mpa-category="模板" data-mpa-module-spacing="paragraphs" data-mpa-spacer-mode="line-height" data-mpa-template="t" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-category="模板" data-mpa-internal-spacing="paragraphs" data-mpa-template="t" yb-mpa-mark="mark-header"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-align-set-style="t" data-mpa-category="模板" data-mpa-component="frost.split-title" data-mpa-component-instance="cover" data-mpa-component-variant="cover" data-mpa-spacer-mode="line-height" data-mpa-template="t" data-template-split-unit="cover"><section data-mid=""><section data-ignore-width="" data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:225" data-mpa-attachment="module-background" data-mpa-role="decoration" nodeleaf=""><p><span style="color: #7F7F7F; font-size: 14px;"><em>来源：多模态信息融合</em></span></p><p><span style="color: #7F7F7F; font-size: 14px;"><em>文章链接：https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/SVr9DmtPyzORLYad-tNR-g</em></span></p></section><section data-ignore-width="" data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:225" data-mpa-attachment="module-background" data-mpa-role="decoration" nodeleaf=""></section><section data-mid=""><section data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:226" data-mpa-attachment="module-overlay" data-mpa-containment="label" data-mpa-containment-base="" data-mpa-stretch="" data-no-dark=""><section data-mid=""><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-lines="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-header-title"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-containment-content="" data-mpa-text-line="0" data-mpa-text-owner="" data-no-dark=""><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-content=""><span data-mid="" data-mpa-adaptive-content="" leaf="">多模态融合</span></section></section><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-line="1" data-mpa-text-owner="" data-no-dark="" style="box-sizing: border-box;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-content=""><span data-mid="" data-mpa-adaptive-content="" leaf="">何时失效？</span></section></section></section><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-owner="" data-no-dark="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-header-sub-title" style="font-size: 17px;line-height: 25.5px;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.84375px;color: rgb(213, 114, 63);box-sizing: border-box;min-width: 0px;max-width: 100%;word-break: break-word;overflow-wrap: anywhere;text-align: center;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-content=""><span data-mid="" data-mpa-adaptive-content="" leaf="">ACM MM 2026 · CoReFuse-Med</span></section></section></section><section data-mid="" data-mpa-animation-slot="413:228" style="display: grid;grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 1fr);box-sizing: border-box;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;max-width: 100%;flex-shrink: 0;grid-area: 1 / 1;width: 168.883px;place-self: end;margin-right: -5.412px;margin-bottom: 7.71px;"><section data-ignore-width="" data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:226" data-mpa-attachment="module-overlay" data-mpa-role="decoration" nodeleaf="" style="width: 128.1%;min-width: 0px;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;margin: -1.46497% 0.197239% -2.44738% -30.373%;max-width: none !important;"><br/></section></section><section data-mid="" data-mpa-animation-slot="413:231" style="display: grid;grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 1fr);box-sizing: border-box;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;max-width: 100%;flex-shrink: 0;grid-area: 1 / 1;width: 49px;place-self: end start;margin-left: 10px;margin-bottom: 24px;"><section data-ignore-width="" data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:226" data-mpa-attachment="module-overlay" data-mpa-role="decoration" nodeleaf="" style="width: 122.097%;min-width: 0px;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;margin: -9.04419% -10.1649% -9.69021% -11.9317%;max-width: none !important;"><br/></section></section></section></section></section></section><p data-mid="" data-mpa-spacer="true" style="line-height: 20px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p><section data-mid="" data-mpa-category="模板" data-mpa-spacer-mode="line-height" data-mpa-template="t" data-template-split-unit="introduction" style="box-sizing: border-box;width: 100%;min-width: 0px;font-family: system-ui;padding: 0px 12.89px;"><section data-mid="" style="box-sizing: border-box;display: grid;grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 1fr);padding-bottom: 5.76px;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:242" data-mpa-attachment="module-background" data-mpa-background-frame="nine-slice" data-mpa-containment="frame" data-mpa-containment-base="" data-mpa-frame-slices="20 20 20 20" data-mpa-frame-source="349.2344 145.4729" data-mpa-frame-widths="20 20 20 20" data-mpa-stretch="" style="grid-area: 1 / 1;margin-top: 7.77px;display: grid;grid-template-columns: 20px minmax(0px, 1fr) 20px;grid-template-rows: 20px auto 20px;gap: 0px;min-width: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-frame-segment="top-left" data-no-dark="" style="box-sizing: border-box;grid-area: 1 / 1;min-width: 0px;background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/j3T39ECe9ClllCclVYAsEJ7iaddiazkLkaabiacYOHZHPe4Kjpic8aGmKgVZJKQsicKjjFu9NKRIhiaSGdD6p7JHkMVOyoicOaQjazQvZPxovZgBZA/640?from=appmsg&quot;);background-size: 1746.17% 727.365%;background-position: 0% 0%;background-repeat: no-repeat;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section data-mid="" data-mpa-frame-segment="top" data-no-dark="" style="box-sizing: border-box;grid-area: 1 / 2;min-width: 0px;background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/j3T39ECe9ClllCclVYAsEJ7iaddiazkLkaabiacYOHZHPe4Kjpic8aGmKgVZJKQsicKjjFu9NKRIhiaSGdD6p7JHkMVOyoicOaQjazQvZPxovZgBZA/640?from=appmsg&quot;);background-size: 112.935% 727.365%;background-position: 50% 0%;background-repeat: no-repeat;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section data-mid="" data-mpa-frame-segment="top-right" data-no-dark="" style="box-sizing: border-box;grid-area: 1 / 3;min-width: 0px;background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/j3T39ECe9ClllCclVYAsEJ7iaddiazkLkaabiacYOHZHPe4Kjpic8aGmKgVZJKQsicKjjFu9NKRIhiaSGdD6p7JHkMVOyoicOaQjazQvZPxovZgBZA/640?from=appmsg&quot;);background-size: 1746.17% 727.365%;background-position: 100% 0%;background-repeat: no-repeat;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section data-mid="" data-mpa-frame-segment="left" data-no-dark="" style="box-sizing: border-box;grid-area: 2 / 1;min-width: 0px;background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/j3T39ECe9ClllCclVYAsEJ7iaddiazkLkaabiacYOHZHPe4Kjpic8aGmKgVZJKQsicKjjFu9NKRIhiaSGdD6p7JHkMVOyoicOaQjazQvZPxovZgBZA/640?from=appmsg&quot;);background-size: 1746.17% 137.924%;background-position: 0% 50%;background-repeat: no-repeat;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section data-mid="" data-mpa-frame-segment="center" data-no-dark="" style="box-sizing: border-box;grid-area: 2 / 2;min-width: 0px;background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/j3T39ECe9ClllCclVYAsEJ7iaddiazkLkaabiacYOHZHPe4Kjpic8aGmKgVZJKQsicKjjFu9NKRIhiaSGdD6p7JHkMVOyoicOaQjazQvZPxovZgBZA/640?from=appmsg&quot;);background-size: 112.935% 137.924%;background-position: 50% 50%;background-repeat: no-repeat;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section data-mid="" data-mpa-frame-segment="right" data-no-dark="" style="box-sizing: border-box;grid-area: 2 / 3;min-width: 0px;background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/j3T39ECe9ClllCclVYAsEJ7iaddiazkLkaabiacYOHZHPe4Kjpic8aGmKgVZJKQsicKjjFu9NKRIhiaSGdD6p7JHkMVOyoicOaQjazQvZPxovZgBZA/640?from=appmsg&quot;);background-size: 1746.17% 137.924%;background-position: 100% 50%;background-repeat: no-repeat;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section data-mid="" data-mpa-frame-segment="bottom-left" data-no-dark="" style="box-sizing: border-box;grid-area: 3 / 1;min-width: 0px;background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/j3T39ECe9ClllCclVYAsEJ7iaddiazkLkaabiacYOHZHPe4Kjpic8aGmKgVZJKQsicKjjFu9NKRIhiaSGdD6p7JHkMVOyoicOaQjazQvZPxovZgBZA/640?from=appmsg&quot;);background-size: 1746.17% 727.365%;background-position: 0% 100%;background-repeat: no-repeat;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section data-mid="" data-mpa-frame-segment="bottom" data-no-dark="" style="box-sizing: border-box;grid-area: 3 / 2;min-width: 0px;background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/j3T39ECe9ClllCclVYAsEJ7iaddiazkLkaabiacYOHZHPe4Kjpic8aGmKgVZJKQsicKjjFu9NKRIhiaSGdD6p7JHkMVOyoicOaQjazQvZPxovZgBZA/640?from=appmsg&quot;);background-size: 112.935% 727.365%;background-position: 50% 100%;background-repeat: no-repeat;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section data-mid="" data-mpa-frame-segment="bottom-right" data-no-dark="" style="box-sizing: border-box;grid-area: 3 / 3;min-width: 0px;background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/j3T39ECe9ClllCclVYAsEJ7iaddiazkLkaabiacYOHZHPe4Kjpic8aGmKgVZJKQsicKjjFu9NKRIhiaSGdD6p7JHkMVOyoicOaQjazQvZPxovZgBZA/640?from=appmsg&quot;);background-size: 1746.17% 727.365%;background-position: 100% 100%;background-repeat: no-repeat;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section data-mid="" data-mpa-frame-content="" style="padding: 17.23px 15.11px 14.24px;grid-area: 1 / 1 / 4 / 4;min-width: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-containment-content="" data-mpa-text-owner="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-intro" style="font-size: 15px;line-height: 28.5px;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.59375px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);box-sizing: border-box;min-width: 0px;max-width: 100%;word-break: break-word;overflow-wrap: anywhere;text-align: justify;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-content=""><span data-mid="" data-mpa-adaptive-content="" leaf="" style="font-size: 16px;">多模态并不是越多越好。当MRI已经空间对齐，但是T1、T2、FLAIR等模态的采样质量差别很大时，低质量模态可能会把高质量模态中产生的重采样伪影一起带入到融合网络中去。CoReFuse-Med从浅层污染和深层模态偏置这两个方面来对症下药地进行修复。</span></section></section><section data-block-id="core-info" style="box-sizing: border-box;margin-top: 12px;padding-top: 10px;border-top: 1px solid rgb(230, 203, 182);font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.85;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);text-align: justify;"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px;"><strong style="color: rgb(185, 83, 31);"><span leaf="">论文标题：</span></strong><span leaf="">When Fusion Fails: Corruption-Aware Rebalanced Fusion for Multi-Modal Medical Image Segmentation</span></p><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px;"><strong style="color: rgb(185, 83, 31);"><span leaf="">作者：</span></strong><span leaf="">Yuchen Pei, Xiaoyu Hu, Yixiong Zou, Dingwen Hu, Hui Chu, Yutao Ma, Shijun Qiu, Gang Li</span></p><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px;"><strong style="color: rgb(185, 83, 31);"><span leaf="">单位：</span></strong><span leaf="">华中师范大学、华中科技大学、广州中医药大学及其第一附属医院、北卡罗来纳大学教堂山分校</span></p><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px;"><strong style="color: rgb(185, 83, 31);"><span leaf="">论文链接：</span></strong></p><p><span leaf="">https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.10261</span></p><p style="margin: 0px;"><strong style="color: rgb(185, 83, 31);"><span leaf="">代码链接：</span></strong></p><p><span leaf="">https://github.com/lrever/CoReFuse</span></p></section></section></section><section data-ignore-width="" data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:242" data-mpa-attachment="module-overlay" data-mpa-role="decoration" nodeleaf="" style="box-sizing: border-box;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;max-width: 100%;flex-shrink: 0;grid-area: 1 / 1;align-self: start;width: 22px;margin-left: 39.11px;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eeefa4d16.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.8181818181818182" data-w="66" style="display: block;width: 100%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;object-fit: contain;background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eeefa4d16.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section data-ignore-width="" data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:242" data-mpa-attachment="module-overlay" data-mpa-role="decoration" nodeleaf="" style="box-sizing: border-box;font-size: