A0YemvbHoOgk1TE/640?from=appmsg&quot;);background-size: 2911.26% 2245.61%;background-position: 100% 100%;background-repeat: no-repeat;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section data-mid="" data-mpa-frame-content="" data-mpa-internal-spacing="paragraphs" style="padding: 9.23px 9.23px 11.24px;grid-area: 1 / 1 / 4 / 4;min-width: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section data-mid="" style="box-sizing: border-box;display: flex;align-items: center;column-gap: 14px;width: 100%;min-width: 0px;padding: 0px 6px;margin-top: 9px;"><section data-mid="" style="box-sizing: border-box;display: flex;align-items: center;column-gap: 11px;flex: 1 1 0px;min-width: 0px;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-containment-content="" data-mpa-text-owner="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-main-text" style="font-size: 14px;line-height: 26.6px;font-weight: 500;letter-spacing: 0.5625px;color: rgb(246, 162, 97);box-sizing: border-box;min-width: 0px;max-width: 100%;word-break: break-word;overflow-wrap: anywhere;flex: 0 1 auto;"><section nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef085ffd.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.6380449141347424" data-s="300,640" data-type="png" data-w="757" type="block" data-imgfileid="100009611" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef085ffd.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-content=""><span data-mid="" data-mpa-adaptive-content="" leaf="" style="font-size: 16px;">FUSION FAILURE · FIG. 1</span></section></section><section data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:325" data-mpa-attachment="module-overlay" data-mpa-role="decoration" style="border: 1px solid rgb(246, 162, 97);box-sizing: border-box;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;max-width: 100%;flex: 1 1 0px;min-width: 0px;height: 0px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p data-mid="" data-mpa-spacer="true" style="line-height: 29px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p><section data-mid="" data-mpa-component="frost-descent-chapter-body" data-mpa-component-instance="chapter-body-1" data-mpa-component-variant="one" template-split-ignore="" style="box-sizing: border-box;display: grid;grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 1fr);grid-template-rows: auto;width: 100%;min-width: 0px;padding-right: 14px;padding-left: 14px;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:334" data-mpa-attachment="module-background" data-mpa-containment="card" data-mpa-containment-base="" data-mpa-internal-spacing="paragraphs" data-mpa-stretch="" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);border-radius: 10px;box-sizing: border-box;grid-area: 1 / 1;width: 100%;min-width: 0px;margin-top: 29px;padding-top: 46px;padding-bottom: 47px;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-category="模板" data-mpa-internal-spacing="paragraphs" data-mpa-spacer-mode="line-height" data-mpa-template="t" data-template-split-unit="chapter-1-lead-collage" data-mpa-action-id="mveoqj74211g" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" style="box-sizing: border-box;width: 100%;min-width: 0px;font-family: system-ui;padding-right: 14px;padding-left: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);display: flex;flex-direction: column;"><section data-flow-push="" data-mid="" data-mpa-containment-content="" data-mpa-text-owner="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-main-text" style="font-size: 15px;line-height: 28.5px;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.59375px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);box-sizing: border-box;min-width: 0px;max-width: 100%;word-break: break-word;overflow-wrap: anywhere;z-index: 2;width: 100%;text-align: justify;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-content=""><span data-mid="" data-mpa-adaptive-content="" leaf="" style="font-size: 16px;">论文在IH EPVS数据集中对高分辨率T1单模态DSC进行了观察，并发现了一个出乎意料的结果：高分辨率T1单模态DSC为0.703，融合T1、T2 和 FLAIR 后反而降到大约 0.695。空间对齐并不等同于信息质量的一致性。低分辨率序列经过重采样之后，其图像和T1同大小，但是可能会含有不可靠的信息。</span></section></section></section><p data-mid="" data-mpa-spacer="true" style="line-height: 22px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p><section data-mid="" data-mpa-internal-spacing="paragraphs" template-split-ignore="" style="box-sizing: border-box;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-align-set-style="t" data-mpa-category="模板" data-mpa-component="frost.split-title" data-mpa-component-instance="chapter-1-phenology-title" data-mpa-component-variant="chapter-n-phenology-title" data-mpa-spacer-mode="line-height" data-mpa-template="t" data-template-split-unit="chapter-1-phenology-title" style="box-sizing: border-box;width: 100%;min-width: 0px;font-family: system-ui;padding-right: 14px;padding-left: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);display: flex;justify-content: center;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-align-content="" style="box-sizing: border-box;display: grid;grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 1fr);grid-template-rows: auto;width: fit-content;max-width: 100%;min-width: 0px;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:334" data-mpa-attachment="module-background" data-mpa-containment="label" data-mpa-containment-base="" data-mpa-stretch="" data-no-dark="" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nV1iaI5g4z7j2sqYrQ3w2eLOJJqGNHfjIbsTFjOLgz6BaK0ZOoiarr1EWTiaRpicPoSodhpiat4koAVBIGlicTVMnOGY6d3PnicmhdQB14rpLUkdAA/640?from=appmsg&quot;);background-repeat: no-repeat;background-size: 100% 100%;box-sizing: border-box;grid-area: 1 / 1;width: fit-content;max-width: 100%;min-width: 0px;padding: 12px 37px 9.6px;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-containment-content="" data-mpa-text-owner="" data-no-dark="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-main-title" style="font-size: 16px;line-height: 30.4px;font-weight: 500;letter-spacing: 0.796875px;color: rgb(85, 40, 17);box-sizing: border-box;min-width: 0px;max-width: 100%;word-break: break-word;overflow-wrap: anywhere;text-align: center;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-content=""><span data-mid="" data-mpa-adaptive-content="" leaf="">三个证据：污染和偏见</span></section></section></section><section data-ignore-width="" data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:334" data-mpa-attachment="module-overlay" data-mpa-role="decoration" nodeleaf="" style="box-sizing: border-box;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;max-width: 100%;flex-shrink: 0;grid-area: 1 / 1;width: 31px;place-self: start;margin-top: -3px;margin-left: -4px;z-index: 1;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef0a6184.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.8387096774193549" data-w="93" style="display: block;width: 100%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;object-fit: contain;background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef0a6184.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section data-ignore-width="" data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:334" data-mpa-attachment="module-overlay" data-mpa-role="decoration" nodeleaf="" style="box-sizing: border-box;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;max-width: 100%;flex-shrink: 0;grid-area: 1 / 1;width: 31px;place-self: end;margin-right: -9px;margin-bottom: 6px;z-index: 1;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef0c572f.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1" data-w="93" style="display: block;width: 100%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;object-fit: contain;background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef0c572f.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section><p data-mid="" data-mpa-spacer="true" style="line-height: 19px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p><section data-mid="" data-mpa-category="模板" data-mpa-spacer-mode="line-height" data-mpa-template="t" data-template-split-unit="chapter-1-phenology-introduction" style="box-sizing: border-box;width: 100%;min-width: 0px;font-family: system-ui;padding-right: 14px;padding-left: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><section data-flow-push="" data-mid="" data-mpa-containment-content="" data-mpa-text-owner="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-main-text" style="font-size: 15px;line-height: 28.5px;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.59375px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);box-sizing: border-box;min-width: 0px;max-width: 100%;word-break: break-word;overflow-wrap: anywhere;width: 100%;text-align: justify;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-content=""><span data-mid="" data-mpa-adaptive-content="" leaf="" style="font-size: 16px;">作者把问题限定在了分辨率不同所引起的质量问题下降上，并没有涉及到未对齐或者模态全部缺失的情况。首先比较浅层特征的F-CNR，然后联合训练梯度和遮挡测试，最后跟踪跳跃连接的噪声传播：由此可以解释为什么“弱训练贡献”也有可能是“强推理干扰”。</span></section></section></section></section><p data-mid="" data-mpa-spacer="true" style="line-height: 26px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p><section data-mid="" data-mpa-category="模板" data-mpa-spacer-mode="line-height" data-mpa-template="t" data-template-split-unit="chapter-1-phenology-list" style="box-sizing: border-box;width: 100%;min-width: 0px;font-family: system-ui;padding-right: 14px;padding-left: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:367" data-mpa-attachment="module-background" data-mpa-containment="card" data-mpa-containment-base="" data-mpa-stretch="" style="border: 1px solid rgb(243, 195, 113);border-radius: 10px;box-sizing: border-box;display: grid;grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 1fr);grid-template-rows: auto;width: 100%;min-width: 0px;padding: 20px 6px 0px;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-template-rows="1" style="box-sizing: border-box;grid-area: 1 / 1;width: 100%;min-width: 0px;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-component="frost.list-row" data-mpa-component-instance="frost-list-row-1" data-mpa-internal-spacing="paragraphs" style="box-sizing: border-box;width: 100%;min-width: 0px;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-component="frost.list-row-heading" data-mpa-component-instance="frost-list-row-heading-1" style="box-sizing: border-box;display: flex;align-items: flex-end;column-gap: 2px;min-width: 0px;padding-right: 47px;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:334" data-mpa-attachment="module-background" data-mpa-containment="label" data-mpa-containment-base="" data-mpa-stretch="" data-no-dark="" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/Irv5ALJ5dlS1Iec1BgBovZUI9MMH6RzmgOTGRzwJH8RiaLFCkLUCibBIf3zbw9BO5XAXTkTQB8IY38NBdTVcR8qVuW9d1vNgxnh5N7dxsibVwc/640?from=appmsg&quot;);background-repeat: no-repeat;background-size: 100% 12px;box-sizing: border-box;width: fit-content;max-width: 100%;min-width: 0px;padding-right: 16px;padding-left: 13px;background-position: left bottom 2.5px;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-containment-content="" data-mpa-text-owner="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-main-title" style="font-size: 15px;line-height: 28.5px;font-weight: 500;letter-spacing: 0.59375px;color: rgb(85, 40, 17);box-sizing: border-box;min-width: 0px;max-width: 100%;word-break: break-word;overflow-wrap: anywhere;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-content=""><span data-mid="" data-mpa-adaptive-content="" leaf="" style="font-size: 16px;">证据一：低分辨率产生噪声</span></section></section></section><section data-ignore-width="" data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:334" data-mpa-attachment="module-overlay" data-mpa-role="decoration" nodeleaf="" style="box-sizing: border-box;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;max-width: 100%;flex-shrink: 0;width: 20px;margin-bottom: 2.5px;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef0e9978.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1" data-w="60" style="display: block;width: 100%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;object-fit: contain;background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef0e9978.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section><p data-mid="" data-mpa-spacer="true" style="line-height: 16px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p><section data-flow-push="" data-mid="" data-mpa-containment-content="" data-mpa-text-owner="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-main-text" style="font-size: 15px;line-height: 28.5px;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.59375px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);box-sizing: border-box;min-width: 0px;max-width: 100%;word-break: break-word;overflow-wrap: anywhere;padding-right: 7px;padding-left: 7px;text-align: justify;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-content=""><span data-mid="" data-mpa-adaptive-content="" leaf="" style="font-size: 16px;">论文中提出的特征对比噪声比F-CNR：用病灶区和背景区的均值之差除以背景区的标准差来衡量可分性。第三页特征可视化显示，T1的F-CNR值是1.0283，T2的F-CNR值是0.4301，FLAIR的F-CNR值只有0.2980；T1 约为 FLAIR 的 3.4 倍。即使从几何上来说是重合的，但是浅层表征的可靠性却不一样。</span></section></section><section data-block-id="eq01_fcnr" data-source-equation="式(1)｜F-CNR：病灶和背景特征可以区分" style="box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;margin: 10px 0px 16px;padding: 10px 6px;background-color: rgb(255, 251, 246);border-top: 1px solid rgb(243, 195, 113);border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(243, 195, 113);text-align: center;overflow-x: auto;"><section style="font-size: 16px;color: rgb(85, 40, 17);"><span data-tool="mdnice编辑器" style="cursor: pointer;"><section data-formula="\text{F-CNR}_{j}=\frac{\left|\mu_{\mathrm{sig},j}-\mu_{\mathrm{bg},j}\right|}{\sigma_{\mathrm{bg},j}+\epsilon}" style="text-align: center;overflow: auto hidden;display: block;max-width: 100%;padding: 6px 0px;"><svg data-formula="\text{F-CNR}_{j}=\frac{\left|\mu_{\mathrm{sig},j}-\mu_{\mathrm{bg},j}\right|}{\sigma_{\mathrm{bg},j}+\epsilon}" style="display:block;width:auto !important;height:auto !important;max-width:100% !important;margin:0 auto;overflow:visible;" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24.985ex" height="5.626ex" role="img" focusable="false" viewbox="0 -1505.2 11043.6 2486.8"><g stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" transform="scale(1,-1)"><g data-mml-node="math"><g data-mml-node="msub"><g data-mml-node="mtext"><path data-c="46" d="M128 619Q121 626 117 628T101 631T58 634H25V680H582V676Q584 670 596 560T610 444V440H570V444Q563 493 561 501Q555 538 543 563T516 601T477 622T431 631T374 633H334H286Q252 633 244 631T233 621Q232 619 232 490V363H284Q287 363 303 363T327 364T349 367T372 373T389 385Q407 403 410 459V480H450V200H4