cing: 0.59375px;color: rgb(85, 40, 17);box-sizing: border-box;min-width: 0px;max-width: 100%;word-break: break-word;overflow-wrap: anywhere;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-content=""><span data-mid="" data-mpa-adaptive-content="" leaf="" style="font-size: 16px;">证据二：优化和推理不一致</span></section></section></section><section data-ignore-width="" data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:334" data-mpa-attachment="module-overlay" data-mpa-role="decoration" nodeleaf="" style="box-sizing: border-box;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;max-width: 100%;flex-shrink: 0;width: 20px;margin-bottom: 2.5px;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef112a14.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1" data-w="60" style="display: block;width: 100%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;object-fit: contain;background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef112a14.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section><p data-mid="" data-mpa-spacer="true" style="line-height: 16px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p><section data-flow-push="" data-mid="" data-mpa-containment-content="" data-mpa-text-owner="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-main-text" style="font-size: 15px;line-height: 28.5px;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.59375px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);box-sizing: border-box;min-width: 0px;max-width: 100%;word-break: break-word;overflow-wrap: anywhere;padding-right: 7px;padding-left: 7px;text-align: justify;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-content=""><span data-mid="" data-mpa-adaptive-content="" leaf="" style="font-size: 16px;">在EPVS的3D U-Net中，T1占据了77.4%的梯度贡献，FLAIR只占到了13.1%；但是遮挡FLAIR会使DSC降低70.2%，和遮挡T1的影响一样大。梯度更新次数少，并不代表在预测的时候就没有影响了。论文把反差看作是优化——推理不一致性的主要证据。</span></section></section><p data-mid="" data-mpa-spacer="true" style="line-height: 28px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p></section><section data-mid="" data-mpa-component="frost.list-row" data-mpa-component-instance="frost-list-row-3" data-mpa-internal-spacing="paragraphs" style="box-sizing: border-box;width: 100%;min-width: 0px;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-component="frost.list-row-heading" data-mpa-component-instance="frost-list-row-heading-3" style="box-sizing: border-box;display: flex;align-items: flex-end;column-gap: 2px;min-width: 0px;padding-right: 47px;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:334" data-mpa-attachment="module-background" data-mpa-containment="label" data-mpa-containment-base="" data-mpa-stretch="" data-no-dark="" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YfXuOqXKDDqwo0bem2J0xE0t8hOnT2zVVqHfIqLYbaJvP1QjvJRoqJibudpLTAKaH73U9MovYjbibdKsr0ibrpMT1Fe3treJByBDjvaaUC6Piac/640?from=appmsg&quot;);background-repeat: no-repeat;background-size: 100% 12px;box-sizing: border-box;width: fit-content;max-width: 100%;min-width: 0px;padding-right: 16px;padding-left: 13px;background-position: left bottom 2.5px;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-containment-content="" data-mpa-text-owner="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-main-title" style="font-size: 15px;line-height: 28.5px;font-weight: 500;letter-spacing: 0.59375px;color: rgb(85, 40, 17);box-sizing: border-box;min-width: 0px;max-width: 100%;word-break: break-word;overflow-wrap: anywhere;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-content=""><span data-mid="" data-mpa-adaptive-content="" leaf="" style="font-size: 16px;">证据三｜Skip 连接会传染</span></section></section></section><section data-ignore-width="" data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:334" data-mpa-attachment="module-overlay" data-mpa-role="decoration" nodeleaf="" style="box-sizing: border-box;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;max-width: 100%;flex-shrink: 0;width: 20px;margin-bottom: 2.5px;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef133d24.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1" data-w="60" style="display: block;width: 100%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;object-fit: contain;background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef133d24.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section><p data-mid="" data-mpa-spacer="true" style="line-height: 16px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p><section data-flow-push="" data-mid="" data-mpa-containment-content="" data-mpa-text-owner="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-main-text" style="font-size: 15px;line-height: 28.5px;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.59375px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);box-sizing: border-box;min-width: 0px;max-width: 100%;word-break: break-word;overflow-wrap: anywhere;padding-right: 7px;padding-left: 7px;text-align: justify;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-content=""><span data-mid="" data-mpa-adaptive-content="" leaf="" style="font-size: 16px;">U 型网络中的 skip connections 本来是用来把空间细节送入解码器的；在各向异性MRI中，它也会把重采样的结构伪影一起带到新的图像中去。网络又倾向于依靠更加“干净”的、容易被优化的高质量模态，因此出现了特征污染和贪婪模态选择的问题。</span></section></section><p data-mid="" data-mpa-spacer="true" style="line-height: 28px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p></section></section><section data-ignore-width="" data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:367" data-mpa-attachment="module-overlay" data-mpa-role="decoration" nodeleaf="" style="box-sizing: border-box;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;max-width: 100%;flex-shrink: 0;grid-area: 1 / 1;width: 54px;place-self: start end;margin-top: -23px;margin-right: -9px;z-index: 1;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef152645.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.7962962962962963" data-w="162" style="display: block;width: 100%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;object-fit: contain;background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef152645.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section></section><section data-ignore-width="" data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:334" data-mpa-attachment="module-overlay" data-mpa-role="decoration" nodeleaf="" style="box-sizing: border-box;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;max-width: 100%;flex-shrink: 0;grid-area: 1 / 1;width: 100%;align-self: start;