af="" style="font-size: 16px;">COREFUSE-MED·FIG.3</span></section></section><section data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:248" data-mpa-attachment="module-overlay" data-mpa-role="decoration" style="border: 1px solid rgb(246, 162, 97);box-sizing: border-box;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;max-width: 100%;flex: 1 1 0px;min-width: 0px;height: 0px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section></section><section data-mid="" data-mpa-animation-slot="413:262" style="display: grid;grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 1fr);box-sizing: border-box;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;max-width: 100%;flex-shrink: 0;width: 28px;"><section data-ignore-width="" data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:248" data-mpa-attachment="module-overlay" data-mpa-role="decoration" nodeleaf="" style="width: 128.571%;min-width: 0px;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;margin: -8.58844% -11.5646% -9.26871% -17.0068%;max-width: none !important;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef310f63.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.8888888888888888" data-w="189" style="display: block;width: 100%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;object-fit: contain;background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef310f63.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef33f2f2.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.26120033812341503" data-s="300,640" data-type="png" data-w="1183" type="block" data-imgfileid="100009617" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef33f2f2.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p data-mid="" data-mpa-spacer="true" style="line-height: 29px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p><section data-mid="" data-mpa-component="frost-descent-chapter-body" data-mpa-component-instance="chapter-body-2" data-mpa-component-variant="two" template-split-ignore="" style="box-sizing: border-box;display: grid;grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 1fr);grid-template-rows: auto;width: 100%;min-width: 0px;padding-right: 14px;padding-left: 14px;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:266" data-mpa-attachment="module-background" data-mpa-containment="card" data-mpa-containment-base="" data-mpa-internal-spacing="paragraphs" data-mpa-stretch="" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);border-radius: 10px;box-sizing: border-box;grid-area: 1 / 1;width: 100%;min-width: 0px;margin-top: 29px;padding-top: 46px;padding-bottom: 47px;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-category="模板" data-mpa-internal-spacing="paragraphs" data-mpa-spacer-mode="line-height" data-mpa-template="t" data-template-split-unit="chapter-2-lead-collage" style="box-sizing: border-box;width: 100%;min-width: 0px;font-family: system-ui;padding-right: 14px;padding-left: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);display: flex;flex-direction: column;"><section data-flow-push="" data-mid="" data-mpa-containment-content="" data-mpa-text-owner="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-main-text" style="font-size: 15px;line-height: 28.5px;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.59375px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);box-sizing: border-box;min-width: 0px;max-width: 100%;word-break: break-word;overflow-wrap: anywhere;z-index: 2;width: 100%;text-align: justify;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-content=""><span data-mid="" data-mpa-adaptive-content="" leaf="" style="font-size: 16px;">CoReFuse-Med 不是简单的再堆一个更强大的cross-attention，而把融合分成两部分：LACE首先给每个MRI序列构建出高效的各向异性编码；IMSH对浅层结构基底和残差之间的可靠传递负责；MBCF 在深层次共享语义空间中重新校准模态贡献。仍然是一套三流、对称U型分割网络。</span></section></section></section><p data-mid="" data-mpa-spacer="true" style="line-height: 25px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p><p data-mid="" data-mpa-spacer="true" style="line-height: 25px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p><section data-mid="" data-mpa-internal-spacing="paragraphs" template-split-ignore="" style="box-sizing: border-box;width: 100%;min-width: 0px;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-align-set-style="t" data-mpa-category="模板" data-mpa-component="frost.split-title" data-mpa-component-instance="chapter-2-numbered-title-1" data-mpa-component-variant="chapter-n-numbered-title-n" data-mpa-spacer-mode="line-height" data-mpa-template="t" data-template-split-unit="chapter-2-numbered-title-1" style="box-sizing: border-box;width: 100%;min-width: 0px;font-family: system-ui;padding-right: 14px;padding-left: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-component="frost.numbered-heading" data-mpa-component-instance="frost-numbered-heading-1" style="box-sizing: border-box;display: flex;align-items: flex-start;column-gap: 9px;width: 100%;min-width: 0px;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:266" data-mpa-attachment="module-background" data-mpa-containment="label" data-mpa-containment-base="" data-mpa-stretch="" data-no-dark="" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NQAyAB92fF4uB4fHlBg1pPY5FIm7rC2IHPcic1ZFjHUmibj6pJyibVlHSkndVmUCPYGOqlr0YicxUwoK5ORiaSsk2EPbda8BTd8InkKpiciaLTHQiaQ/640?from=appmsg&quot;);background-repeat: no-repeat;background-size: 100% 100%;box-sizing: border-box;flex: 0 1 auto;width: fit-content;max-width: 24%;min-width: 0px;margin-top: 3px;padding-right: 13px;padding-left: 13px;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-containment-content="" data-mpa-text-kind="sequence" data-mpa-text-owner="" data-no-dark="" style="font-size: 16px;line-height: 30.4px;font-weight: 600;letter-spacing: 0.640625px;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box;min-width: 0px;max-width: 100%;word-break: break-word;overflow-wrap: anywhere;text-align: center;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-content=""><span data-mid="" data-mpa-adaptive-content="" leaf="">01</span></section></section></section><section data-flow-push="" data-mid="" style="box-sizing: border-box;display: grid;grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 1fr);grid-template-rows: auto;flex: 1 1 0px;min-width: 0px;"><section data-ignore-dm="low-contrast text-bg-gradient" data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:278" data-mpa-attachment="module-background" data-mpa-containment="label" data-mpa-containment-base="" data-mpa-stretch="" style="border-radius: 5px;box-sizing: border-box;grid-area: 1 / 1;min-width: 0px;padding: 3px 12px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(255, 244, 221) 13.8748%, rgba(255, 244, 221, 0) 100%);"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-containment-content="" data-mpa-text-owner="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-main-title" style="font-size: 16px;line-height: 30.4px;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.640625px;color: rgb(185, 83, 31);box-sizing: border-box;min-width: 0px;max-width: 100%;word-break: break-word;overflow-wrap: anywhere;padding-right: 15px;z-index: 1;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-content=""><span data-mid="" data-mpa-adaptive-content="" leaf="">LACE+IMSH浅层先“去污染”</span></section></section></section><section data-mid="" data-mpa-animation-slot="413:282" style="display: grid;grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 1fr);box-sizing: border-box;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;max-width: 100%;flex-shrink: 0;grid-area: 1 / 1;width: 28.9px;place-self: start end;margin-right: -1.8px;z-index: 2;"><section data-ignore-width="" data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:266" data-mpa-attachment="module-overlay" data-mpa-role="decoration" nodeleaf="" style="width: 100.378%;min-width: 0px;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;margin: 5.04626% -2.08859% -1.56995% 1.71012%;max-width: none !important;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef367cbe.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.7096774193548387" data-w="93" style="display: block;width: 100%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;object-fit: contain;background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef367cbe.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section></section></section><p data-mid="" data-mpa-spacer="true" style="line-height: 24px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p><section data-mid="" data-mpa-category="模板" data-mpa-internal-spacing="paragraphs" data-mpa-spacer-mode="line-height" data-mpa-template="t" data-template-split-unit="chapter-2-numbered-section-1" style="box-sizing: border-box;width: 100%;min-width: 0px;font-family: system-ui;padding-right: 14px;padding-left: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><section data-flow-push="" data-mid="" data-mpa-containment-content="" data-mpa-text-owner="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-main-text" style="font-size: 15px;line-height: 28.5px;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.59375px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);box-sizing: border-box;min-width: 0px;max-width: 100%;word-break: break-word;overflow-wrap: anywhere;width: 100%;text-align: justify;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-content=""><span data-mid="" data-mpa-adaptive-content="" leaf="" style="font-size: 16px;">LACE 使用局部DoubleConv和沿着D、H、W三个方向的条带卷积分支来分别保留细节、捕获轴向上下文，之后用可选的通道注意力融合两支特征。IMSH使用无参数的3×3×3平均池化分离结构作为基础，并且用高频残差来代替低频残差：基底部分用竞争性的Softmax权重选择可靠解剖结构，残差部分由共享Sigmoid门控过滤重采样伪影组成，最后用轻量级DSConv3D来整合。</span></section></section><section data-mpa-component="frost.research-note" style="font-size: 16px;line-height: 30px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-align: justify;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);padding: 0px 0px 12px;word-break: break-word;overflow-wrap: anywhere;"><strong data-emphasis-role="technical" style="color: rgb(60, 112, 198);"><span leaf="">LACE 双分支选择性融合：</span></strong><span leaf="">局部边界和轴向上下文分别提取出来之后，再用自适应权重进行合成。</span></section><section nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef3916d3.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.43636363636363634" data-s="300,640" data-type="png" data-w="550" type="block" data-imgfileid="100009618" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef3916d3.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section data-block-id