rk="" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kXzuKG9bXhZwicV2Kc9JxbgTsDaKrYQebB7eNMUT44YJ7YicOmKAOVYHyNXicTZGa7hB2VbnHfib5tkxn9qucTwVkSm905oI52Hia99ZqvrmtXvc/640?from=appmsg&quot;);background-repeat: no-repeat;background-size: 100% 100%;box-sizing: border-box;flex: 0 1 auto;width: fit-content;max-width: 24%;min-width: 0px;margin-top: 3px;padding-right: 13px;padding-left: 13px;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-containment-content="" data-mpa-text-kind="sequence" data-mpa-text-owner="" data-no-dark="" style="font-size: 16px;line-height: 30.4px;font-weight: 600;letter-spacing: 0.640625px;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box;min-width: 0px;max-width: 100%;word-break: break-word;overflow-wrap: anywhere;text-align: center;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-content=""><span data-mid="" data-mpa-adaptive-content="" leaf="">02</span></section></section></section><section data-flow-push="" data-mid="" style="box-sizing: border-box;display: grid;grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 1fr);grid-template-rows: auto;flex: 1 1 0px;min-width: 0px;"><section data-ignore-dm="low-contrast text-bg-gradient" data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:295" data-mpa-attachment="module-background" data-mpa-containment="label" data-mpa-containment-base="" data-mpa-stretch="" style="border-radius: 5px;box-sizing: border-box;grid-area: 1 / 1;min-width: 0px;padding: 3px 12px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(255, 244, 221) 13.8748%, rgba(255, 244, 221, 0) 100%);"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-containment-content="" data-mpa-text-owner="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-main-title" style="font-size: 16px;line-height: 30.4px;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.640625px;color: rgb(185, 83, 31);box-sizing: border-box;min-width: 0px;max-width: 100%;word-break: break-word;overflow-wrap: anywhere;padding-right: 15px;z-index: 1;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-content=""><span data-mid="" data-mpa-adaptive-content="" leaf="">MBCF｜对深层纠正模态偏见</span></section></section></section><section data-mid="" data-mpa-animation-slot="413:299" style="display: grid;grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 1fr);box-sizing: border-box;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;max-width: 100%;flex-shrink: 0;grid-area: 1 / 1;width: 28.9px;place-self: start end;margin-right: -1.8px;z-index: 2;"><section data-ignore-width="" data-mid="" data-mpa-anchor="413:266" data-mpa-attachment="module-overlay" data-mpa-role="decoration" nodeleaf="" style="width: 101.682%;min-width: 0px;font-size: 0px;line-height: 0;margin: 4.61172% -3.28007% -2.06056% 1.59798%;max-width: none !important;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef3e29f1.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.7096774193548387" data-w="93" style="display: block;width: 100%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;object-fit: contain;background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef3e29f1.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section></section></section><p data-mid="" data-mpa-spacer="true" style="line-height: 24px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p><section data-mid="" data-mpa-category="模板" data-mpa-internal-spacing="paragraphs" data-mpa-spacer-mode="line-height" data-mpa-template="t" data-template-split-unit="chapter-2-numbered-section-2" style="box-sizing: border-box;width: 100%;min-width: 0px;font-family: system-ui;padding-right: 14px;padding-left: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><section data-flow-push="" data-mid="" data-mpa-containment-content="" data-mpa-text-owner="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-main-text" style="font-size: 15px;line-height: 28.5px;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.59375px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);box-sizing: border-box;min-width: 0px;max-width: 100%;word-break: break-word;overflow-wrap: anywhere;width: 100%;text-align: justify;"><section data-mid="" data-mpa-text-content=""><span data-mid="" data-mpa-adaptive-content="" leaf="" style="font-size: 16px;">MBCF的作用是针对L3-L4深层跳连特征。首先把T1、T2、FLAIR的全局描述拼接起来，经过共享MLP产生通道权重；再利用空间门控来排除由于位置不稳而产生的不可靠响应；最后得到的是一个不属于任何一个单一模态的公共查询Q，对三模态拼接并下采样K、V执行对称交叉注意力。目的并不是要迫使所有的模态都以相同的权重来发言，而是在融合的时候给可信的信息合理的贡献。</span></section><section nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef416cb6.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.9500924214417745" data-s="300,640" data-type="png" data-w="541" type="block" data-imgfileid="100009620" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261019/6ad5eef416cb6.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section><section data-mpa-component="frost.research-note" style="font-size: 16px;line-height: 30px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-align: justify;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);padding: 0px 0px 12px;word-break: break-word;overflow-wrap: anywhere;"><span leaf="">全局通道校准并不是通过Softmax强行使三个模态的权重相加等于1，而是在共享MLP和Sigmoid之间产生条件化的通道权重；空间门控和共享查询更加限制了模态的竞争。</span></section><section data-block-id="eq05_mbcf_channels" data-source-equation="式(5)为全局通道可靠性的校正" style="box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;margin: 10px 0px 16px;padding: 10px 6px;background-color: rgb(255, 251, 246);border-top: 1px solid rgb(243, 195, 113);border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(243, 195, 113);text-align: center;overflow-x: auto;"><section style="font-size: 16px;color: rgb(85, 40, 17);"><span data-tool="mdnice编辑器" style="cursor: pointer;"><section data-formula="\begin{gathered}\left[w_{T1},w_{T2},w_{\mathrm{FLAIR}}\right]\\=\sigma\big(\operatorname{MLP}(v_{\mathrm{joint}})\big)\end{gathered}" style="text-align: center;overflow: auto hidden;display: block;max-width: 100%;padding: 6px 0px;"><svg data-formula="\begin{gathered}\left[w_{T1},w_{T2},w_{\mathrm{FLAIR}}\right]\\=\sigma\big(\operatorname{MLP}(v_{\mathrm{joint}})\big)\end{gathered}" style="display:block;width:auto !important;height:auto !important;max-width:100% !important;margin:0 auto;overflow:visible;" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" xmlns="http://www.w3.or